      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1759255775410,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "API Layer - Handling the Request (handlers.go):",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "API Layer - Handling the Request (handlers.go):",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "S05EsUbbc9rd5MtfKAGJ6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3386.430437231615,
      "y": 64.21462659378474,
      "width": 616,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0d",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1652208259,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1993485869,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1759255775410,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "(3a) Bind & Validate: The handler receives the raw\nrequest. It uses ShouldBindJSON to parse the JSON into a\nmodel.RegisterUserRequest struct. This is where Gin's\nvalidation (binding:\"required\") happens.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "(3a) Bind & Validate: The handler receives the raw request. It uses ShouldBindJSON to parse the JSON into a model.RegisterUserRequest struct. This is where Gin's validation (binding:\"required\") happens.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "lBTVuMecVt3jLll1qLfMr",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3375.430437231615,
      "y": 221.71462659378471,
      "width": 638,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0e",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 497150765,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 961599267,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1759255775410,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "(3b) Business Logic: The handler performs logic that isn't\ndirectly related to the database, like securely hashing\nthe user's password using bcrypt.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "(3b) Business Logic: The handler performs logic that isn't directly related to the database, like securely hashing the user's password using bcrypt.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "RWRnzKb9xKEA6S-m68FRC",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3380.930437231615,
      "y": 341.7146265937847,
      "width": 627,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0f",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1982294563,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1646649485,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1759255775410,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "(3c) Prepare for Storage: It then maps the validated data\nfrom the RegisterUserRequest into a model.User struct,\nwhich matches the database table structure.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "(3c) Prepare for Storage: It then maps the validated data from the RegisterUserRequest into a model.User struct, which matches the database table structure.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "-Kd9LA8-sT93bUeF4VV0h",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3386.430437231615,
      "y": 449.2146265937847,
      "width": 616,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0g",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1911946637,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 605027011,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1759255775410,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Calling the Storage Layer: The handler calls the\nCreateUser method, passing the *model.User object to the\nstorage layer. It's now \"hands-off\" and waits for a\nresult.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Calling the Storage Layer: The handler calls the CreateUser method, passing the *model.User object to the storage layer. It's now \"hands-off\" and waits for a result.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "4ZOJovCxI6Sdj7gXpJAj5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3413.930437231615,
      "y": 631.7146265937847,
      "width": 561,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0h",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1318858179,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1628718829,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1759255775410,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Storage Layer - Database Interaction (postgres.go):",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Storage Layer - Database Interaction (postgres.go):",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "hJdO65yGkkPYVTBf4zRDk",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3386.430437231615,
      "y": 676.7146265937847,
      "width": 616,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0i",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 450413549,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 510241379,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1759255775410,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The CreateUser method's only job is to talk to the\ndatabase. It takes the model.User struct and uses GORM's\ndb.Create() function.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The CreateUser method's only job is to talk to the database. It takes the model.User struct and uses GORM's db.Create() function.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "bJBJ_DqYWzf3odrVDdgBX",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3397.430437231615,
      "y": 809.2146265937847,
      "width": 594,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0j",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 787971427,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 371646797,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1759255775410,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "GORM translates this method call into a raw SQL INSERT\nINTO users (...) statement.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "GORM translates this method call into a raw SQL INSERT INTO users (...) statement.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "f2w-z9DUWg7cynpzUsib7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3375.430437231615,
      "y": 891.7146265937847,
      "width": 638,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0k",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2085862989,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1831626243,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1759255775410,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Database Execution: The PostgreSQL database executes the\ncommand, creates a new user record, and assigns a UUID and\ntimestamps.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Database Execution: The PostgreSQL database executes the command, creates a new user record, and assigns a UUID and timestamps.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "lgxR0Eku3JtjWVpJbb6fp",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3386.430437231615,
      "y": 1024.2146265937847,
      "width": 616,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0l",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1921505539,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 381104045,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1759255775410,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Return from DB: The database returns the result (success\nor an error, like a duplicate email) to the GORM client.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Return from DB: The database returns the result (success or an error, like a duplicate email) to the GORM client.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "_ck2OAC5zaMkNBbRolkfi",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3375.430437231615,
      "y": 1106.7146265937847,
      "width": 638,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0m",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1027632301,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 928427427,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1759255775410,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Return from Storage: The CreateUser method gets the result\nfrom GORM and returns an error (or nil if successful) back\nto the handler.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Return from Storage: The CreateUser method gets the result from GORM and returns an error (or nil if successful) back to the handler.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "cu_MVOt1L9PoKlj39VuXX",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3419.430437231615,
      "y": 1251.7146265937847,
      "width": 550,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0n",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 114016419,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 284078605,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1759255775410,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "API Layer - Formatting the Response (handlers.go):",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "API Layer - Formatting the Response (handlers.go):",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "iuA5_PUJ08pT_gzcw791X",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3375.430437231615,
      "y": 1284.2146265937847,
      "width": 638,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0o",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1833455373,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1075249475,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1759255775410,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "(9a) Error Handling: The handler checks the returned\nerror. If it's a specific error (like a duplicate key), it\nsends a 409 Conflict status. If it's another error, it\nsends a 500 Internal Server Error.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "(9a) Error Handling: The handler checks the returned error. If it's a specific error (like a duplicate key), it sends a 409 Conflict status. If it's another error, it sends a 500 Internal Server Error.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "9n_S_ly5LjmwwUkM-bzpD",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3375.430437231615,
      "y": 1441.7146265937847,
      "width": 638,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0p",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 628208707,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 835119213,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1759255775410,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "(9b) Create Safe Response: If there's no error, it creates\na model.UserResponse DTO. This is critical for security,\nas it omits the PasswordHash.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "(9b) Create Safe Response: If there's no error, it creates a model.UserResponse DTO. This is critical for security, as it omits the PasswordHash.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "QMCt9lqHY--rQjHbX1vjc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3386.430437231615,
      "y": 1574.2146265937847,
      "width": 616,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0q",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1793385837,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1623974115,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1759255775410,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Response Sent: The handler sends the final JSON response\nand a 201 Created status code back to the client.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Response Sent: The handler sends the final JSON response and a 201 Created status code back to the client.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
  ],
